{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1000_p", "source_sha256": "36d0c5367310e7498075d43fb9b037da2a17845fad3fa7954bba9f9e5e3182ae", "ja": "（星梨花が出演するドラマの衣装が届き、\nこれからフィッティングなのだが……）", "zh": "（星梨花出演的电视剧服装送到了，接下来要试装了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d86093cc226860343045d1bc6641c1e99a835e34380e0de5075128c7dde52550", "ja": "ごめん星梨花、遅くなった！\n新しい衣装の件だけど……。", "zh": "对不起，星梨花，我来晚了！\n关于新服装的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "076fca321ca98f23d2f3c55ed09160218aff7a97431ec41fffab393137503804", "ja": "ぐすっ……やっと来てくれたんですね。\nわたし、嫌われちゃったのかと思いました……。", "zh": "呜……您终于来了。\n我还以为，您是不是讨厌我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "4a14357ac559dff629cd703f2ba0e9ffc7ab7e20ef6ae8e5f07fffe497f2487c", "ja": "{$P$}さんは……わたしのこと\nなんて、どうでもいいのかもって……ぐすっ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生是不是……觉得我\n怎样都无所谓了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1004_p", "source_sha256": "71d6eea8568fcd57887d0e362c4744f62687164fdcc991368c1ad7550215eb31", "ja": "星梨花！？　そ、そんなことないぞ！\nどうでもいいなんて、絶対にないからな！", "zh": "星梨花！？才、才不是那样！我绝对没有觉得你无所谓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "c11d38400c60d3916826920d30c9404255de09220dee1883327eec5c61759e3d", "ja": "じゃあ、お仕事より、わたしの方が大切ですか……？", "zh": "那么，比起工作，我更重要吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e11550cb89d99c4528f43b9f3cfbfbaf107ad3c3acf2a733ebfb47bbd9f65f11", "ja": "星梨花のことは大切だ。大切なんだけど……\nそれはアイドルとしてというか……。", "zh": "星梨花很重要。虽然很重要，但是……\n该说是作为偶像来重视她……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1007_p", "source_sha256": "be7af6fceceda785a7e7d0e2067db6281b433004d94e60d207560817e20072a5", "ja": "でもアイドルは仕事だから結局は両方か？\nいや、でも……。", "zh": "不过偶像毕竟是工作，所以说到底，两个都是吗？不，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "8967f132d76b343b6ea40b4c7cae6b1ce3bed68f9976d55fbacdac61554e66ea", "ja": "あっ……ごめんなさい！\n今のは、お芝居の練習だったんです。", "zh": "啊……对不起！\n刚才那是在练习演戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "333a69e12cbfe275a793774ec78bbc7ac3b67386160a6522a743a4f11975bf96", "ja": "{$P$}さんが\nそんなに困るとは思わなくて……。", "zh": "没想到会让{$P$}先生\n这么为难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1010_p", "source_sha256": "da75801b178a11cd09325cdc204a6ed4e5bd78067940e964775ddac66c8e0f96", "ja": "なんだ、お芝居の練習か。\nそれなら良かった。", "zh": "什么啊，原来是在练习戏剧。\n那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "7c228cb0039d47ca7511cf6cef9e5db14e2cc42b5b4d0e767a1f76503f947679", "ja": "はい！　せっかく衣装に着替えたので、\nちょっとドラマの役の練習をしてみたくって。", "zh": "是的！难得换上了服装，\n所以想试着练习一下电视剧里的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "61d731bfb00e5453306544b6112d5e004ea0bfbbbd20e4b5a052faa79fab2c7a", "ja": "こんな感じなのかなって、やってみたんですけど……\nあの、どうでしたか？　ヤンデレになってましたか？", "zh": "我想着大概是这种感觉，就试着演了一下……\n那个，怎么样？有演出病娇的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1013_p", "source_sha256": "badf2c8082d25515c67bc61f5b78a9ebbad393bec5fe850dda3e5349e619c8b6", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだったと思うよ。\n本当に焦ったし……。", "zh": "啊，我觉得演得非常到位。\n真的把我吓得够呛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "b5b76739111bd404cfa835c0a017049e77f497e2c7c1321ae9873849bc251202", "ja": "本当ですか？　えへへ、うれしいです♪", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1ad352a539944885b150d559038ee00f9ee212f1c21bb26ed4d70a735bce762a", "ja": "まだ練習したいなら、本読みに付き合おうか？", "zh": "要是还想练习的话，我来陪你对台词吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "a90baa265f6fd6ae2103550c064d3f1aa1631f15edefad286808c8c465f70e01", "ja": "いいえ、もう大丈夫です！\nそれに、演技の練習でも……。", "zh": "不用了，我已经没问题了！\n而且，就算是练习演戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "032db21750e7a96c14160c30ab89ad7b976c1cab2c5c034905ed71083b96dcc1", "ja": "{$P$}さんにウソをつくの、\nやっぱりイヤだなって……。", "zh": "对{$P$}先生说谎，\n我果然还是讨厌这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1018_p", "source_sha256": "20ed573558840b96b27a4285aa0298345d12bfd4629b5031114a33b24da2851e", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n星梨花がそう言うなら、このくらいにしておこうか。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n既然星梨花都这么说了，那就先到此为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "436e03099d3ef1d9fc14d0ab892ab61bf60524b7d9e55ffb2f05c7e6c9079fdf", "ja": "はい！　あ、でも{$P$}さんを\nずっと待ってたっていうのは、本当ですよ！", "zh": "是的！啊，不过我一直在等着{$P$}先生，这是真的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "56c545d752642512d762e09891e5fc5328f2696ac7dcd8ad32075f764ff1a2b8", "ja": "衣装の感想、聞かせて欲しいなって……。\nお願いしてもいいですか？", "zh": "想听您说说对衣装的看法……\n可以拜托您吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1021_p", "source_sha256": "548fe24326143f77f998d9fabe03f8c2fcc0e23c17f0ed57eb493e5caaebb1e9", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。それじゃ改めて伝えさせてもらうよ。\nまず、星梨花に似合ってて驚いた。それに……。", "zh": "啊，当然可以。那我就重新告诉你吧。\n首先，这身衣服很适合星梨花，让我很惊讶。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0534_1022_p", "source_sha256": "70d339af5b14945e2c472bdc0a3931da67d091814f8267c25b739ed1ee624e33", "ja": "（たくさんの感想を伝えると、星梨花も喜んでくれた。\n衣装も気に入ってもらえたようでよかった……）", "zh": "（把许多感想告诉了星梨花，她也很开心。她似乎也很喜欢服装，太好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
